      "statement": "Cross-image operations include whole-image CoW clone (oifs_clone_image using APFS clonefile, Linux FICLONE, or standard copy), 3-tier file transfer (Reflink -> copy_file_range -> Raw Block -> Logical Re-encode) via oifs_transfer_file_to, and sub-range splice with trim modes (KEEP, PUNCH_HOLE, COLLAPSE) via oifs_splice_range_to.",
